OL,3,GNEWSAAccused tells court he thought
OL,4,Aman's wife had consented to sex
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has told a court he believed a
OL,7,Fwoman who was repeatedly raped by her
OL,8,F"vile monster" husband had consented
OL,9,Fwhen he answered an ad to have sex with
OL,10,Fthe couple.
OL,12,FNorman Macksoni, 48, Richard Wilkins,
OL,13,F62, Connor Sanderson-Doyle, 32, and
OL,14,FMohammed Hassan, 38, are on trial at
OL,15,FWinchester Crown Court after denying
OL,16,Fsexual offences against Joanne Young,
OL,17,Fwho has waived her right to anonymity.
OL,19,FEx-Tory councillor Philip Young, 50,
OL,20,Fhas admitted charges of drugging and
OL,21,Fraping his now ex-wife over 13 years at
OL,22,Ftheir home in Swindon, Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
