OL,5,
OL,6,FDescribing his reaction after his
OL,7,Farrest, Sanderson-Doyle told the court:
OL,8,F"I didn't think someone could do
OL,9,Fsomething like that to their wife. It's
OL,10,Fjust vile, vile."
